@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Listar usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Perfil de un usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/ana

### Recomendaciones para ana
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/ana/recommendations

### Crear usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "juan_e",
  "email": "juan@correo.com",
  "favoriteGenres": ["rock", "indie"]
}

### Seguir a luis
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/juan_e/following
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "luis" }

### Dar like a una cancion
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/juan_e/likes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "songId": "reptilia" }

### Canciones de rock ordenadas por likes
GET {{baseUrl}}/songs?genre=rock

### Crear cancion con metadata libre
POST {{baseUrl}}/songs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fix You",
  "artist": "Coldplay",
  "genre": "rock",
  "duration": "4m55s",
  "metadata": { "album": "X&Y", "year": 2005 }
}

### Quitar like
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/juan_e/likes/reptilia
